# Home Screen Images Directory

## Purpose

This directory holds **static image assets used by the v2 home screen** (`frontend/src/features/home/HomePage.tsx`). Currently:

- **`home-hero.png`** — 1× master landscape Victory Harben art for the "Welcome to Excelsior" hero banner.
- **`home-hero-2x.png`** — 2× retina PNG generated from the master (`npm run generate:home-hero`). Committed alongside the master; referenced via `srcSet` on the hero `<img>`. Use `-2x` (not `@2x`) in the filename so URLs stay safe on all hosts.

Rendered as `<img className="home__hero-art-image">` inside `.home__hero-art`, right-aligned and height-scaled to the welcome tile.

## Rules

- **Edit only `home-hero.png`**, then run **`npm run generate:home-hero`** (or `--force`) to regenerate `home-hero-2x.png`.

- **These images are committed to git** (UI images under `src/resources/images/**` are not gitignored) and are synced to S3/CloudFront by the deploy workflow, so they load from the CDN in production.
- **Reference via `assetUrl('/src/resources/images/home/<file>')`** in the frontend (CDN-safe). Do NOT hardcode CDN URLs or use CSS `url()` with an absolute `/src/...` path (it would resolve against the SPA origin, not the CDN).
- **Not auto-discovered.** Unlike `backgrounds/landscape` (deck-editor picker), files here are referenced explicitly. Adding a file requires a code reference; it will not appear anywhere automatically.
- **No thumbnails** — the card thumbnail pipeline does not process this directory; do not add a `thumb/` subfolder.

## Related Context

- Home page component: `frontend/src/features/home/HomePage.tsx`
- Home page styles: `frontend/src/features/home/HomePage.css`
- Asset URL helper: `frontend/src/lib/images/cardImages.ts` (`assetUrl`)
